SUMMARY:DOC TALK #1 (60m) - Ericka
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Ericka Brian\nRoom: OV North Conference \nLoca
 tion: Ocotillo Village\nDOC TALK #1: Be the CEO of Your Health — Ow
 n Your Data\, Not Just Your Diet\nSaturday August 8th at 9am-10am\n\n
 Take ownership of your health by learning how to shift from reactive 
 care to proactive wellness. Dr. Surkunte will provide an internal med
 icine perspective on understanding advanced biomarkers\, body composi
 tion\, metabolic health\, and the difference between “normal” ver
 sus optimal health indicators for long-term performance and preventio
 n. Ericka Avila Brian\, MBA\, CHW\, PTT will guide participants throu
 gh reflective exercises and health literacy discussions designed to h
 elp attendees assess their personal wellness priorities and create a 
 more intentional roadmap for their health journey.\n\nPrice: $25 for 
 members/ $45 for non-members\nLocation: Conference Room\nEricka | ebr
 ian@dmbclubs.com
END:VEVENT
